	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Level Objects",
	"Description": "Placeable level objects that offer traversal surfaces: the trampoline (an adjustable box that launches whoever lands on it). They implement the GSTNSurface provider contract, so the combat impacts and the launch consumer read them without knowing the class. Needs no GAS, Network Prediction or Mover.",
